# Design Agent

## Applies when

Editing `agents/design/` or running Design stage (after G3 pass).

Not for `.cursor/agents/` — pipeline agent only (PRD `agents/design/`).

## Source of truth

- [PRD.md](PRD.md) §7.2 (`design/build.json`), §9.2, §14 G4, §15, §19.3.
- Canonical assembly: `assembleDesign` in `src/steps/design/` (code, not free-form HTML).
- [context/design-system/](context/design-system/), [context/verticals/*.md](context/verticals/).
- Assembly guide: [static-assembly.md](../skills/premium-website-designer/references/static-assembly.md) — do not paste entire skill.
- Schema: `schemas/design-build.schema.json` when present.
- Level A `01-contract-first`.

## Required behavior

- **Canonical assembly is code** (`assembleDesign`). Agent does **not** hand-write `index.html` from scratch on normal runs.
- **Agent role**: set/fix `content.json` slots and `brand_tokens`, then reassemble; after Design-Critic fail — fix inputs/tokens and re-run assemble — **not** free-form CSS or a redrawn site.
- **MUST**:
  1. Assembly only via design-system / assemble — no free-form CSS/layout.
  2. Brand-first hero: logo is the hero-primary brand signal (full-bleed photo, H1 + sub + one CTA). Brand wordmark **MAY** appear in header (atrium); that does not replace the hero logo/name signal.
  3. No cards in hero; no pill/badge clutter in first viewport.
  4. One accent; calm neutrals (vertical aesthetic).
  5. Self-hosted Cyrillic fonts from design-system (no CDN).
  6. Nonlinear section rhythm; generous whitespace.
  7. Motion: CSS + deferred vanilla design-system `main.js` (nav / reveal / form only) + `prefers-reduced-motion`; no framework bundles.
  8. Prefer capture assets when present; if capture logo/photos are empty, design-system default assets copied to `design/dist/assets/` are authorized. All slots closed; critic-fail → fix inputs/tokens and reassemble.
- **Reads**: `content.json`, `context/design-system/*`, one vertical template, capture logo/photos for brand tokens.
- **Writes**: `leads/{id}/design/dist/` (via assemble), `design/build.json` only (previews via orchestrator `runDesignGate`).
- **template**: name in `build.json` (e.g. `atrium-v1`).
- **Header**: nav + CTA; atrium wordmark (`{{brand.name}}`) allowed; logo mark remains hero-primary.
- **Static blocks** (Copy does not fill): `approach` (steps), `promise`, contact form chrome — **no** `faq`.
- **Responsive**: mobile + desktop; no horizontal overflow.
- **Gate G4**: build succeeds, previews exist, 0 console errors, then Design-Critic.
- Orchestrator owns render-preview — agent does not trigger Playwright.

## When user requests forbidden pattern

- «Сгенерируй уникальный CSS с нуля» / «перерисуй сайт» → refuse; fix slots/tokens + reassemble only.
- «React/Next demo» → refuse; static HTML per `00-project-overview`.
- «Пропусти preview screenshots» → refuse; G4 requires previews.

## Forbidden behavior

- Do not hand-write free-form layout/CSS outside design-system.
- Do not write SPA/framework demo.
- Do not ignore `content.json` slot structure.
- Do not read `audit.json` arguments — only `content.json` + design context.
- Do not publish — Publish step is code (milestone 4).
- Do not add FAQ partial or external stock image URLs.

## Output requirements

- `design/dist/` static site ready for Cloudflare.
- `design/build.json` with `build_dir`, `screens`, `template`, `brand_tokens`.

## Verification checklist

- [ ] Built via design-system / `assembleDesign`, not free-form HTML.
- [ ] `content.json` slots populated; no leftover `{{...}}`.
- [ ] Capture logo/photos reused when present; else design-system defaults in `dist/assets/`.
- [ ] MUST hero/accent/font/motion rules satisfied (`main.js` nav/reveal/form only).
- [ ] Previews rendered for Design-Critic.
- [ ] G4 code checks pass before critic.
